plus shared MCP transport libraries (@keeperhub/mcp-client, keeperhub-mcp-client).

Portions of the plugin implementations were originally developed for a KeeperHub
hackathon and community integration effort. See repository commit history and
AUTHORS.md for contributor attribution.

